    "rules": [
      "Text never hard-cuts: swap with blur(4px) + 4px rise, 180ms.",
      "Panels enter from their trigger: scale .96 → 1, blur 8px → 0, origin at the trigger.",
      "Containers animate height with layout springs; children stagger 30ms.",
      "Progress fills have a soft feathered leading edge, not a hard line.",
      "Removed rows collapse height and fade together; strike-through draws left to right first.",
      "Success moments get one small burst (confetti or check) and a badge pop, never a modal.",
      "Sections reveal once on scroll: blur 8px + 16px rise, children staggered 60ms. Respect prefers-reduced-motion."
    ]
